    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "ZPE-201 Extension of treatment",
      "detailedDescription": "This is an extension of the phase II, three-arm, parallel design, dose-ranging, placebo-controlled, randomized, double-blind, multicenter study in which placebo or one (1) of two (2) dose levels of Proellex® was administered once-daily for four (4) months."
    },
